    // heading and nothing else (no member's metres, no clock, no picture size): aside, the level angle between the gaze and
    // the heading, to either hand; lift, the gaze over the level. Looking ahead the prow stands whole across the bottom.
    // From ASIDE[0] aside she is lowered, from ASIDE[1] to ASIDE[2] she is WHOLLY out (there the picture's side edge would
    // cut her at the corner), by ASIDE[3] she stands at her full height again; lifted more than LIFT[0] she is lowered, from
